        <section id="section_k5s_wg1_3cc">
            <note id="note_b5c_xg1_3cc">
                <ul id="ul_cc1_jvr_jcc">
                    <li>The path parameter cannot be empty; </li>
                    <li>After the HTTP request is successfully sent, the header and content fields will be automatically cleared to release memory; </li>
                    <li>According to ITU specifications, the sequences comma and double quote (that is: ," and ",), double quote and semicolon (that is: ";) are parameter delimiters in AT commands. If they need to be entered, they shall be escaped or handled with spacing.</li>
                </ul>
            </note>
        </section>
